cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Swahili ASR: parameter-efficient adaptation and speaker-aware evaluation of multilingual speech models"
abstract: >-
  Code and evaluation protocol for adapting multilingual Whisper models to Swahili with
  quantized low-rank adaptation under constrained compute. Includes a speaker-aware
  evaluation protocol that holds the model fixed and varies only the test set, measuring
  held-out clips from training speakers, held-out speakers, and an out-of-corpus
  benchmark separately, across model sizes from 244M to 1.55B parameters.
